#step("QHO series to termination E_n = (n+½)ℏω", 1, [$V = ((1)/(2)) k x^2$, $omega = sqrt(k/m)$ into TISE gives $((d^2 psi )/( dif x^2)) + ( ((2m E)/( planck^2)) - ((m^2 omega^2)/( planck^2)) x^2 ) psi = 0$])
#step("QHO series to termination E_n = (n+½)ℏω", 2, [$xi = sqrt((m omega)/planck ) x$, $epsilon.alt = 2E/( planck omega )$ turn it into $psi '' + ( epsilon.alt - xi^2) psi = 0$])
#step("QHO series to termination E_n = (n+½)ℏω", 3, [normalisability demands $psi = H( xi )e^(- xi^2/2)$; substituting its derivatives cancels the $xi^2$ terms and leaves $H'' - 2 xi H' + ( epsilon.alt - 1)H = 0$])
#step("QHO series to termination E_n = (n+½)ℏω", 4, [$H = sum_j h_j xi^j$ in the Hermite equation gives $h_(j+2) = (2j + 1 - epsilon.alt )h_j/((j+1)(j+2))$])
