#step("QHO series to termination E_n = (n+½)ℏω", 6, [any other $epsilon.alt$ leaves $h_(j+2)/h_j -> 1$, so $H tilde e^(+ xi^2)$ and $psi tilde e^(+ xi^2/2)$, not normalisable])
